\par 2.1. C\'e1c ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd, c\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc kinh t\u7871\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc \'d0\u7847\'3fu t
