\'3f D\u7908\'3fNG T\'c0I KHO\u7842\'3fN:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx961\tx1681\tx2401\tx3121\tx3841\tx4561\tx5281\tx6001\tx6721\tx7441\tx8161\tx8881\tx9601\tx10321\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2648023 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 1. T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT:
\par 1.1. \'d0\'fd\u7907\'3fc s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7875\'3f nh\u7853\'3fn, g\u7917\'3fi v\'e0 thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn, qu\u7929\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t, t\'edn d\u7909\'3fng \'fdu \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'e3i v}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7873\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3f
c b\u7857\'3fng \'f0\u7891\'3fng Vi\u7879\'3ft nam ho\u7863\'3fc ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f.
\par 1.2. \'d0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn trong ph\u7841\'3fm vi s\u7889\'3f d\'fd tr\'ean t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi t\u7841\'3fi  Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 tu
\u7923\'3f theo y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn thanh to\'e1n b\u7857\'3fng chuy\u7875\'3fn kho\u7843\'3fn v\'e0 r\'fat ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft theo k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'e3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af38\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f38\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'f0\'e3ng k\'fd, theo \'f0\'fang c\'e1c quy \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7883\'3fnh v\u7873\'3f ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f thanh to\'e1n kh\'f4ng d\'f9ng ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par 1.3. M\u7885\'3fi tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp thanh to\'e1n qu\'e1 s\u7889\'3f d\'fd tr\'ean t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi ho\u7863\'3fc ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fdu k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'fd}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  t\u7841\'3fi Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu ph\u7841\'3ft ti\u7873\'3fn b\u7857
\'3fng 30% (Ba m\'fd\'f5i ph\u7847\'3fn tr\'e3m) tr\'ean s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn ph\'e1t h\'e0nh qu\'e1 s\u7889\'3f d\'fd ( Theo Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 22/Q\'d0 - NH1 ng\'e0y 21/2/1994 c\u7911\'3fa th\u7889\'3fng \'f0\u7889\'3fc Ng
\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc Vi\u7879\'3ft nam ban h\'e0nh v\u7873\'3f th\u7875\'3f l\u7879\'3f thanh to\'e1n kh\'f4ng d\'f9ng ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft). \'d0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 c\'f2n b}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7883\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft ch\u7853\'3fm tr\u7843\'3f b\u7857\'3fng m\u7913\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 c l\'e3i su}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7845\'3ft n\u7907\'3f qu\'e1 h\u7841\'3fn theo m\u7913\'3fc cao nh\u7845\'3ft c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng n
\'f5i Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn.
\par Khi s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn, ph\u7843\'3fi tu\'e2n th\u7911\'3f nh\u7919\'3fng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0 h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 c trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh thanh to\'e1}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 n, ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn, l\u297\'3fnh ti\u7873\'3fn c
\u7911\'3fa Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par 2. T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 n thanh to\'e1n v\'e3ng lai v}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7889\'3fn thu\u7897\'3fc NSTW c
\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT :
\par - T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 n thanh to\'e1n v\'e3ng lai v}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7889\'3fn thu\u7897\'3fc NSTW ch
\u7881\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc m\u7903\'3f t\u7841\'3fi Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t cho vay \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn thu\u7897\'3fc Ng\'e2n s\'e1
ch Trung \'fd\'f5ng . TC\'d0TPT ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp cho c\'e1c C\u7909\'3fc \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f c\u7845\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 p ph\'e1t, cho vay c\'e1c c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh, d}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7921\'3f \'e1n thu\u7897\'3fc NSTW.
\par Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc T\u7881\'3fnh, Th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f h\u7841\'3fn m\u7913\'3fc v\u7889\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t v\'e0 cho vay do Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng th\'f4ng b\'e1o \'f0
\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n, chi tr\u7843\'3f c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t, cho vay \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 i c\'e1c c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh, d}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7921\'3f \'e1n thu\u7897\'3fc ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn NSTW theo ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa C\u7909\'3fc \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875
\'3fn.
\par H\'e0ng ng\'e0y, Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp s\u7889\'3f ph\'e1t sinh \'f0\u7875\'3f b\'e1o n\u7907\'3f cho TC\'d0TPT trong ph\u7841\'3fm vi s\u7889\'3f d\'fd t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g
\u7917\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa TC\'d0TPT.
\par 3. T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd:
\par - C\'e1c ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc m\u7903\'3f v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi t\u7841\'3fi c\'f5 quan \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f ti\u7871\'3f
p nh\u7853\'3fn, thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn li\'ean quan \'f0\u7871\'3fn chi ph\'ed cho ban qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 n l\'fd c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh, chi ph\'ed gi}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7843\'3fi ph\'f3ng m\u7863\'3ft b\u7857\'3fng, chi ph\'ed chu\u7849\'3fn b\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ... do ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871
\'3fp th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn.
\par + Ti\u7871\'3fp nh\u7853\'3fn v\'e0 thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn huy \'f0\u7897\'3fng, v\u7889\'3fn t\u7921\'3f c\'f3 c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd v\u7873\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn, ti\u7871
\'3fp nh\u7853\'3fn, g\u7917\'3fi, thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn t\u7841\'3fm thu ch\u7901\'3f n\u7897\'3fp Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch, t\u7841\'3fm thu ch\u7901\'3f thanh to\'e1n.
\par - C\'e1c ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm tu\'e2n th\u7911\'3f nh\u7919\'3fng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0 h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn v
\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc m\u7903\'3f v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn, th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn nghi\'eam ch\u7881\'3fnh, \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\u7873\'3f l\u7853\'3fp, lu\'e2n chuy\u7875\'3f
n, l\'fdu tr\u7919\'3f ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f thanh to\'e1n qua c\'f5 quan \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn.
\par 4. \'d0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT v\u7899\'3fi vi\u7879\'3fc qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 n l\'fd t\'e0i kho}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7843\'3fn:
\par - Khi ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd \'f0\u7871\'3fn m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn, k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng (ho\u7863\'3fc c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f ph\u7909\'3f tr\'e1ch k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n) c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC
\'d0TPT ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp nh\u7853\'3fn h\u7891\'3f s\'f5, xem x\'e9t, ki\u7875\'3fm tra t\'ednh h\u7907\'3fp l\u7879\'3f, h\u7907\'3fp ph\'e1p c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f, ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh ghi s\u7889\'3f
 hi\u7879\'3fu t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn, ng\'e0y th\'e1ng b\u7855\'3ft \'f0\u7847\'3fu ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng l\'ean gi\u7845\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af38\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f38\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 y \'f0\'e3ng k\'fd m}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn, b\u7843\'3fn m\u7851\'3fu ch\u7919\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  k\'fd v\'e0 m}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7851\'3fu d\u7845\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd, k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'fd t\'ea
n l\'ean gi}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7845\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af38\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f38\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 y \'f0\'e3ng k\'fd m}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn v\'e0 chuy\u7875\'3fn to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f h\u7891\'3f s\'f5 tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'ecnh Th}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7911\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  k\'fd duy}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7879\'3ft. C\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft vi\u7879\'3fc m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917
\'3fi cho ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ngay trong ng\'e0y l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc.
\par - Sau khi \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'e3 ch}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7845\'3fp nh\u7853\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho
\u7843\'3fn, c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn th\'f4ng b\'e1o s\u7889\'3f hi\u7879\'3fu t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn v\'e0 ng\'e0y b\u7855\'3ft \'f0\u7847\'3fu ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0
\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f kh\'e1ch h\'e0ng th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx961\tx1681\tx2401\tx3121\tx3841\tx4561\tx5281\tx6001\tx6721\tx7441\tx8161\tx8881\tx9601\tx10321\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10773244 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 - \'d0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 n l\'fd
, ki}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7875\'3fm tra, t\u7841\'3fo m\u7885\'3fi \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn thu\u7853\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi cho ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3f
n c\'e1c nghi\u7879\'3fp v\u7909\'3f thanh to\'e1n an to\'e0n, nhanh ch\'f3ng, \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo cung c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f thanh to\'e1n cho ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd v\'e0 ph\u7843\'3f
i b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn ch\u7863\'3ft ch\u7869\'3f, an to\'e0n c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f thanh to\'e1n thu\u7897\'3fc ph\u7841\'3fm vi qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 n l\'fd. N}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7871\'3fu \'f0\u7875\'3f m\u7845\'3ft m\'e1t, th\u7845\'3ft l\u7841\'3fc g\'e2y h\u7853\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f nghi
\'eam tr\u7885\'3fng s\u7869\'3f ch\u7883\'3fu thi\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3fi v\u7873\'3f v\u7853\'3ft c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10773244 h\u7845\'3ft v\'e0 truy t\u7889\'3f tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'e1p lu\u7853\'3ft.}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qc \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx0\tx270\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10773244 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 IV- M\u7896\'3f
T S\u7888\'3f QUY \'d0\u7882\'3fNH KH\'c1C:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx961\tx1681\tx2401\tx3121\tx3841\tx4561\tx5281\tx6001\tx6721\tx7441\tx8161\tx8881\tx9601\tx10321\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5531538 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 1. T\u7845\'3ft to\'e1n t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn:
\par C\'e1c t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd m\u7903\'3f t\u7841\'3fi \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\u7845\'3ft to\'e1n khi :
\par - Ch\u7911\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn c\'f3 y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu
\par - T\'ednh ch\u7845\'3ft ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd thay \'f0\u7893\'3fi
\par - \'d0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd gi\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc s\'e1t nh\u7853\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kh\'e1c, chuy\u7875\'3fn \'f0\u7871\'3fn \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng kh\'e1c.
\par - Theo y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu hay Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn.
\par 2. T\u7841\'3fm d\u7915\'3fng ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn:
\par C\'e1c t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd m\u7903\'3f t\u7841\'3fi \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT t\u7841\'3fm ng\u7915\'3fng ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng trong c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3f
p sau:
\par - Vi ph\u7841\'3fm k\u7927\'3f lu\u7853\'3ft T\'e0i ch\'ednh, k\u7927\'3f lu\u7853\'3ft thanh to\'e1n.... theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par - Theo Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn.
\par 3. Tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn t\u7845\'3ft to\'e1n t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn v\'e0 ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\u7843\'3fi ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh \'f0\u7889\'3f
i chi\u7871\'3fu, x\'e1c nh\u7853\'3fn s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn \'f0\u7871\'3fn ng\'e0y \'f0\u7889\'3fi chi\u7871\'3fu, l\u7853\'3fp bi\'ean b\u7843\'3fn. Vi\u7879\'3fc x\u7917\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  l\'fd v\'e0 chuy}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7875\'3fn s\u7889\'3f d\'fd c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn \'f0\u7871\'3fn n\'f5i kh\'e1c th\u7921
\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc theo quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx961\tx1681\tx2401\tx3121\tx3841\tx4561\tx5281\tx6001\tx6721\tx7441\tx8161\tx8881\tx9601\tx10321\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14948636 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 4. C\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo an to\'e0n, b\'ed m\u7853\'3ft s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu ph\'e1t sinh tr\'ean t\'e0
i kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd. Vi\u7879\'3fc cung c\u7845\'3fp s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu tr\'ean t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo \'f0\'fang q}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid14948636 uy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid14948636 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qc \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx0\tx270\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14948636 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 B. CH\u7870\'3f
 \'d0\u7896\'3f THANH TO\'c1N:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid2520874 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 I- TR\'c1CH NHI\u7878\'3fM C\u7910\'3fA C\'d5 QUAN C\u7844\'3fP TR\'caN CH\u7910\'3f \'d0\u7846\'3fU T\'dd:}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx961\tx1681\tx2401\tx3121\tx3841\tx4561\tx5281\tx6001\tx6721\tx7441\tx8161\tx8881\tx9601\tx10321\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11667855 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 1. C\'e1c ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f thanh to\'e1n qua c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT c\u7847\'3fn c\'f3 
\'f0\u7911\'3f \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par a. C\'f3 t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn m\u7903\'3f t\u7841\'3fi \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn, bao g\u7891\'3fm: T\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn m\u7913\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t, h
\u7841\'3fn m\u7913\'3fc v\u7889\'3fn vay, t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi.
\par b. N\u7871\'3fu l\'e0 t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 i th\'ec ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 
\u7843\'3fi c\'f3 s\u7889\'3f d\'fd (c\'f3 ti\u7873\'3fn) \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo kh\u7843\'3f n\'e3ng thanh to\'e1n v\'e0 ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng trong ph\u7841\'3fm vi s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn hi\u7879\'3fn c\'f3
 tr\'ean t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n. M\u7885\'3fi tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp kh\'f4ng \'f0\u7911\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n, g\'e2y tr\u7903\'3f ng\u7841\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 i trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh thanh to\'e1n thu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7897\'3fc tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911
\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn v\'e0 ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu ph\u7841\'3ft theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh.
\par 2. C\'e1c ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd c\'f3 quy\u7873\'3fn l\u7921\'3fa ch\u7885\'3fn, tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn \'e1p d\u7909\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 ng h\'ecnh th}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7913\'3fc thanh to\'e1n qua h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng TC\'d0TPT ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7863\'3fc \'f0i\u7875\'3fm, quan h\u7879\'3f cung \u7913\'3fng h\'e0ng ho\'e1
, d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f v\'e0 \'f0\'fang v\u7899\'3fi quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\u7873\'3f nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc thanh to\'e1n.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx961\tx1681\tx2401\tx3121\tx3841\tx4561\tx5281\tx6001\tx6721\tx7441\tx8161\tx8881\tx9601\tx10321\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid16523602 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 3. T\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f thanh to\'e1n qua c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc l\u7853\'3f
p theo \'f0\'fang qu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid16523602 y \'f0\u7883\'3fnh hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh c\u7911\'3fa TC\'d0TPT.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qc \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx961\tx1681\tx2401\tx3121\tx3841\tx4561\tx5281\tx6001\tx6721\tx7441\tx8161\tx8881\tx9601\tx10321\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid16523602 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f0\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 II- TR\'c1CH NHI\u7878\'3fM C\u7910\'3fA C\'c1C \'d0\'d5N V\u7882\'3f THU\u7896\'3fC TC\'d0TPT}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid5469390 :}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx961\tx1681\tx2401\tx3121\tx3841\tx4561\tx5281\tx6001\tx6721\tx7441\tx8161\tx8881\tx9601\tx10321\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5469390 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 1. H\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\'e1c ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd, ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd n\u7855\'3fm v\u7919\'3fng c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, n\u7897\'3f
i dung, th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc v\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc c\u7847\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft ph\u7843\'3fi l\'e0m cho t\u7915\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 ng h\'ecnh th}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7913\'3fc thanh to\'e1n \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7921\'3fa ch\u7885\'3fn v\'e0 th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn.
\par 2. Cung c\u7845\'3fp (b\'e1n) \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f, k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi cho kh\'e1ch h\'e0ng c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi m\u7851\'3fu gi\u7845\'3fy t\u7901\'3f c\u7847\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.

\par 3. Th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc ki\u7875\'3fm tra, gi\'e1m s\'e1t kh\u7843\'3f n\'e3ng chi tr\u7843\'3f c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn, th\'f4ng b\'e1o v\'e0 \'f0\u7889\'3fi chi\u7871\'3fu th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean v\u7899
\'3fi ch\u7911\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn s\u7889\'3f d\'fd c\'e1c t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn m\u7913\'3fc v\'e0 t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi, x\u7917\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  l\'fd k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp vi ph\u7841\'3fm.
\par 4. Khi nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f thanh to\'e1n do kh\'e1ch h\'e0ng n\u7897\'3fp ph\u7843\'3fi ki\u7875\'3fm so\'e1t t\'ednh h\u7907\'3fp ph\'e1p, h\u7907\'3fp l\u7879\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c y\u7871\'3fu t\u7889\'3f tr
\'ean ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f. C\'f3 quy\u7873\'3fn t\u7915\'3f ch\u7889\'3fi thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f thanh to\'e1n l\u7853\'3fp kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fang quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0 kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi
\u7879\'3fm v\u7873\'3f h\u7853\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f do l\u7895\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa kh\'e1ch h\'e0ng g\'e2y n\'ean.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx961\tx1681\tx2401\tx3121\tx3841\tx4561\tx5281\tx6001\tx6721\tx7441\tx8161\tx8881\tx9601\tx10321\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8213208 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 5. Th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f, k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi, ch\'ednh x\'e1c c\'e1c nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f thanh to\'e1n, lu\'e2n chuy\u7875\'3fn ch\u7913\'3fng t
\u7915\'3f. T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc t\u7889\'3ft c\'f4ng t\'e1c thanh to\'e1n trong n\u7897\'3fi b\u7897\'3f, trong to\'e0n h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng \'f0\u7875\'3f ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f kh\'e1ch h\'e0ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thu\u7853\'3fn l\u7907
\'3fi, k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi v\'e0 an to\'e0n t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn. N\u7871\'3fu g\'e2y ch\u7853\'3fm tr\u7877\'3f, sai l\u7847\'3fm, th\u7845\'3ft l\u7841\'3fc, m\u7845\'3ft m\'e1t d\u7851\'3fn \'f0\u7871\'3fn t\u7893\'3fn th\u7845\'3ft t\'e0i s
\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 c\u7911\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 a kh\'e1ch h\'e0ng th\'ec ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
