\par 1. Thanh to\'e1n b\u7857\'3fng s\'e9c (theo m\u7851\'3fu s\'e9c \'f0\'ednh k\'e8m):
\par - Vi\u7879\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng s\'e9c \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 22/Q\'d0-NH1 ng\'e0y 22 th\'e1ng 4 n\'e3m 1994 c
\u7911\'3fa Th\u7889\'3fng \'f0\u7889\'3fc Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc Vi\u7879\'3ft nam .
\par + Ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t h\'e0nh s\'e9c thanh to\'e1n cho \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng. C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\u7889\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t v\'e0 cho vay \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'e3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc C\u7909\'3fc \'d0TPT ph\'ea duy\u7879\'3ft, ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh vi\u7871\'3ft s\'e9c thanh to
\'e1n cho kh\'e1ch h\'e0ng. Khi vi\u7871\'3ft s\'e9c l\'fdu }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'fd: vi}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7871\'3ft \'f0
\'fang, \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f c\'e1c y\u7871\'3fu t\u7889\'3f theo t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi s\'e9c, kh\'f4ng t\u7849\'3fy xo\'e1, s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa, vi\u7871\'3ft ch\u7891\'3fng, \'f0\'e8, vi\u7871\'3ft b\u7857\'3fng m\u7921\'3fc kh
\'f4ng phai, kh\'f4ng vi\u7871\'3ft b\u7857\'3fng m\u7921\'3fc \'f0\u7887\'3f, ch\u7919\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi vi\u7871\'3ft hoa s\'e1t \'f0\u7847\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 u d\'f2
ng, ng\'e0y th\'e1ng ph\'e1t h\'e0nh ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7843\'3fi ghi b\u7857\'3fng ch\u7919\'3f.
\par + Sau khi vi\u7871\'3ft s\'e9c xong, k\u7871\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  to\'e1n tr\'ecnh k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7871\'3f to\'e1
n tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng v\'e0 th\u7911\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  k\'fd t\'ean, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'f0\'f3ng d\u7845\'3fu theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh l\'ean t\u7901\'3f s\'e9c, sau \'f0\'f3 mang s\'e9c c\'f9ng c\'e1c ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f c\'f3 li\'ean quan \'f0\u7871\'3fn \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu
\u7897\'3fc T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc thanh to\'e1n.
\par + \'d0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh ki\u7875\'3fm tra, \'f0\u7889\'3fi chi\u7871\'3fu v\u7899\'3fi s\u7889\'3f v\u7889\'3fn \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'e3 c
\'f3 quy}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t, cho vay ho\u7863\'3fc s\u7889\'3f d\'fd t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911
\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd. N\u7871\'3fu \'f0\u7911\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af38\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f38\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 , \'f0\'fang, k\'fd t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'ean, 
