\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  theo d\'f5i, thanh to\'e1n.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 2. Thanh to\'e1n b\u7857\'3fng u\u7927\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm chi (M\u7851\'3fu UNC \'f0\'ednh k\'e8m):
\par - U\u7927\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm chi l\'e0 gi\u7845\'3fy \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f chi ti\u7873\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc l\u7853\'3fp theo m\u7851\'3fu in s\u7861\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa TC\'d0TPT, y\'eau c\u7847
\'3fu \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT n\'f5i m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn tr\'edch t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 a m\'ecnh tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7843\'3f cho ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi th\u7909\'3f h\'fd\u7903\'3fng.
\par - UNC \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n ti\u7873\'3fn h\'e0ng ho\'e1, d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f, \'f0i\u7873\'3fu chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn ... c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd.
\par - Ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn thanh to\'e1n b\u7857\'3fng UNC theo c\'e1c ph\'fd\'f5ng th
\u7913\'3fc b\u7857\'3fng th\'fd, b\u7857\'3fng \'f0i\u7879\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc b\u7857\'3fng s\'e9c chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn. K\u7871\'3f to\'e1n c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri
\u7875\'3fn ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc thanh to\'e1n cho ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd.
\par - Khi ph\'e1t h\'e0nh UNC, ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd l\u7853\'3fp 6 li\'ean UNC n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT n\'f5i m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n cho b\'ean th\u7909\'3f h\'fd
\u7903\'3fng. Tr\'ean UNC, ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\u7843\'3fi ghi \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f, ch\'ednh x\'e1c c\'e1c y\u7871\'3fu t\u7889\'3f, kh\u7899\'3fp \'f0\'fang n\u7897\'3fi dung gi\u7919\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 a c\'e1c li\'ean UNC v\'e0 k\'fd t\'ean, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'f0\'f3ng d\u7845\'3fu tr\'ean t\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c li\'ean UNC.

\par - Khi nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc UNC c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT ki\u7875\'3fm tra th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc l\u7853\'3fp UNC, s\u7889\'3f d\'fd t\'e0i kho
\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi ho\u7863\'3fc v\u7889\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t, \'f0i vay c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thanh to\'e1n. N\u7871\'3fu vi\u7879\'3fc l\u7853\'3f
p UNC c\'f3 sai s\'f3t nh\'fd ghi sai, kh\'f4ng \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f c\'e1c y\u7871\'3fu t\u7889\'3f, kh\'f4ng \'f0\u7911\'3f li\'ean, kh\'f4ng tr\'f9ng kh\u7899\'3fp gi\u7919\'3fa c\'e1c li\'ean ho\u7863\'3fc thi\u7871\'3fu d\u7845\'3fu, ch
\u7919\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  k\'fd ho}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7863\'3fc s\u7889\'3f d\'fd t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3f
n g\u7917\'3fi, ti\u7873\'3fn vay, v\u7889\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t kh\'f4ng \'f0\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  thanh to\'e1n th\'ec tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7843\'3f l\u7841\'3fi UNC cho ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd.
\par - N\u7871\'3fu UNC \'f0\u7911\'3f \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'d0TPT ghi ng\'e0y, s\u7889\'3f hi\u7879\'3fu t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn N\u7907\'3f, C\'f3 tr\'ean 2 li\'ean UNC (1 li\'ean UNC l\'e0m ch
\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f ghi N\u7907\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd, 1 li\'ean b\'e1o n\u7907\'3f cho ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd), k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'fd t\'ean l\'ean t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c li\'ean UNC, \'f0\'f3ng d\u7845\'3fu v\'e0 n\u7897\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 p 4 li\'ean c\'f2n l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7841\'3fi v\'e0o KBNN n\'f5i m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f
 KBNN th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thanh to\'e1n cho ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi th\u7909\'3f h\'fd\u7903\'3fng.
\par 3. Thanh to\'e1n b\u7857\'3fng s\'e9c chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn:
\par - Ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd mu\u7889\'3fn th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thanh to\'e1n b\u7857\'3fng s\'e9c chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi l\u7853\'3fp 5 li\'ean UNC (c\'e1ch l\u7853\'3fp nh\'fd ph\u7847\'3fn 2 n\'eau tr\'ean) n\u7897
\'3fp v\'e0o \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'d0TPT n\'f5i m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn. N\u7897\'3fi dung ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  ghi r\'f5: h}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7885\'3f t\'ean; S\u7889\'3f, ng\'e0y, th\'e1ng, n\'e3m, n\'f5i c\u7845\'3fp ch\u7913\'3fng minh nh\'e2n d\'e2n c\u7911\'3fa ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi c\u7847\'3fm s\'e9c chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3f
n, n\u7897\'3fi dung chi tr\u7843\'3f c\u7911\'3fa s\'e9c chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn.
\par - \'d0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT ki\u7875\'3fm tra UNC, n\u7871\'3fu th\u7845\'3fy \'f0\'fang, \'f0\u7911\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  th\'ec k\'fd t\'ean, }{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'f0\'f3ng d\u7845\'3fu l\'ean ch\u7895\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, l\'fdu 2 li\'ean, 3 li\'ean \'f0\'fda cho ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd mang sang KBNN \'f0\u7875\'3f l\'e0m th
\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh s\'e9c chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn.
\par - \'d0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT kh\'f4ng th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thanh to\'e1n n\u7897\'3fi b\u7897\'3f cho n\'ean kh\'f4ng ph\'e1t h\'e0nh s\'e9c chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn.
\par 4. Thanh to\'e1n b\u7857\'3fng u\u7927\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm thu:
\par - U\u7927\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm thu (UNT) \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng thanh to\'e1n trong c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu \'e1p d\u7909\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 ng h\'ecnh th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7913\'3fc n\'e0y sau khi \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'e3 c\'f3 h}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'fd k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7871\'3ft gi\u7919\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd v\'e0 b\'ean nh\u7853\'3fn th\u7847\'3fu, cung c\u7845
\'3fp h\'e0ng ho\'e1 d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f, \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi ph\u7843\'3fi c\'f3 v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f.
\par - C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f, ho\'e1 \'f0\'f5n giao h\'e0ng, cung \u7913\'3fng h\'e0ng ho\'e1 d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'e3 c\'f3 ch}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7919\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771  k\'fd x\'e1c nh}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa b\'ean tr\u7843\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn v\'e0 h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f, v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t
\'fd, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn l\u7853\'3fp 4 li\'ean gi\u7845\'3fy u\u7927\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm thu theo m\u7851\'3fu in s\u7861\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa KBNN k\'e8m theo ho\'e1 
\'f0\'f5n ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f g\u7917\'3fi KBNN n\'f5i m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc g\u7917\'3fi tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp t\u7899\'3fi Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng, KBNN b\'ean tr\u7843\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f y\'eau c\u7847\'3f
u thu h\u7897\'3f. Tr\'ean c\'e1c li\'ean UNT ph\u7843\'3fi ghi \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f c\'e1c y\u7871\'3fu t\u7889\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 nh v\'e0 k\'fd t\'ean, }
{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'f0\'f3ng d\u7845\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn.
\par - \'d0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 m theo d\'f5i vi}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7879\'3fc thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c gi\u7845\'3fy u\u7927\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm thu \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'e3 g}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7917\'3fi \'f0i \'f0\u7875\'3f ph\u7889\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi KBNN, Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f b\'ean tr\u7843\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0\'f4n \'f0\u7889\'3fc b\'ean tr\u7843
\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn thanh to\'e1n k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi cho ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd.
\par 5. Thanh to\'e1n b\u7857\'3fng Ng\'e2n phi\u7871\'3fu thanh to\'e1n v\'e0 b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft:
\par - Ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc l\u297\'3fnh ng\'e2n phi\u7871\'3fu thanh to\'e1n v\'e0 ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft \'f0\u7875\'3f s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 ng trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh thanh to\'e1n.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 - Khi c\'f3 nhu c\u7847\'3fu s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng ng\'e2n phi\u7871\'3fu v\'e0 ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft, ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd vi\u7871\'3ft s\'e9c l
\u297\'3fnh ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft (ho\u7863\'3fc ng\'e2n phi\u7871\'3fu) k\'e8m theo gi\u7845\'3fy gi\u7899\'3fi thi\u7879\'3fu r\'fat ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft \'f0\u7871\'3fn n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT n\'f5
i m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn.
\par - \'d0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc TC\'d0TPT ki\u7875\'3fm tra th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc, ki\u7875\'3fm tra s\u7889\'3f d\'fd t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn, th\u7845\'3fy \'f0\'fang, \'f0\u7911\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 , k\'fd t\'ean, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \'f0\'f3ng d\u7845\'3fu l\'ean ch\u7895\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh tr\'ean t\u7901\'3f s\'e9c, \'f0\'fd
a cho ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd \'f0\u7871\'3fn KBNN l\u297\'3fnh ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc ng\'e2n phi\u7871\'3fu s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qc \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx961\tx1681\tx2401\tx3121\tx3841\tx4561\tx5281\tx6001\tx6721\tx7441\tx8161\tx8881\tx9601\tx10321\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11092290 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 
