\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn, t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n, th\'f4ng tin kinh t\u7871\'3f li\'ean quan \'f0\u7871\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 n l\'fd, c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid8537464\charrsid3224771 \u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t v\'e0 cho vay thanh to\'e1n c\'e1c ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ph\'e1t
 tri\u7875\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc thi h\'e0nh k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y 1/1/1995.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s16\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx961\tx1681\tx2401\tx3121\tx3841\tx4561\tx5281\tx6001\tx6721\tx7441\tx8161\tx8881\tx9601\tx10321\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7869471 \rtlch\fcs1 
